The speech model in this package is OpenAI's Whisper base.en, converted to
the ggml format by the whisper.cpp project
(https://huggingface.co/ggerganov/whisper.cpp). Both are under the MIT
license, and both notices follow: Whisper's (https://github.com/openai/whisper)
for the weights, whisper.cpp's (https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp) for
the ggml conversion.

